  abilityDesc: 18 combo Water attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    100% damage reduction for 3 turns, adds all status ailments infliction to attack
    for 3 turns, damage taken fills BB gauge and restores HP for 3 turns & fills
    OD gauge
